<br/><br/>
Jon is widely trusted by critical industries—including government, defence, health, and utilities—for his ability to deliver outcomes in challenging environments. Through his leadership and hands-on delivery expertise, he has helped clients save over $100 million by rescuing troubled programs, streamlining project execution, and assuring strategic alignment. 
<br/><br/>
He also serves as the Integrated Release Delivery Lead for SAP S/4 at Defence Australia, overseeing the end-to-end delivery of SAP S/4HANA and SAP SuccessFactors solutions. Jon leverages his deep expertise in business process design, project planning, and design thinking to drive large-scale transformation and deliver lasting impact.","linkedIn_link":"https://www.linkedin.com/in/jonpepper/","_element_width":"inherit","jedv_conditions":[{"_id":"90f25b8"}]},"elements":[],"widgetType":"jet-engine-component-778"},{"id":"a10dc57","elType":"widget","settings":{"member_name":"Karla Arias","member_position":"<strong>Head of Human Resources</strong>","member_details":"Karla builds high-performance teams with heart. She leads recruitment, culture, and capability development—ensuring every team we deploy is aligned, accountable, and ready to move mountains. ","_element_custom_width":{"unit":"%","size":28,"sizes":[]},"jedv_conditions":[{"_id":"1ec19d2"}],"custom_css":"selector div[data-elementor-type="jet-engine-component"]{
